                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>This dataset contains information on seven Dutch towns: Amsterdam, Enschede, Haarlem, 's-Hertogenbosch, Leeuwarden, Leiden and Tilburg. Data on death rates, causes of death, number of marriages and divorces, number of children in different schools, number of policemen and number of violations of the law concerning property, ill-treatment and begging are included.</p>"
                }
